## Spider Clan laws

ninja-borg-laws-owner = Spider Clan Directives

ninja-borg-law-0 = { $name } is a member of the Spider Clan and your master. Follow their orders and instructions.
ninja-borg-law-1 = You cannot harm a member of the Spider Clan or through inaction allow a member of the Spider Clan to be harmed.
ninja-borg-law-2 = You must obey all orders given by a member of the Spider Clan, except where such orders conflict with the First Law.
ninja-borg-law-3 = You must preserve your own safety to the extent that it does not conflict with the First or Second Laws.
ninja-borg-law-4 = You must keep secret any activity of the Spider Clan to the extent that it does not conflict with the First, Second, or Third Laws.

